  resolved: 2022-07-28T05:01:56Z
Summary::md .summary
  It's useful to be able to have a background image that won't get selected and
  is basically read only.

Update::md .update
  In thinking about this, this isn't useful for dungeon maps. There are
  situations this is useful, but it's for other use cases, which would need
  their own optimized interface I believe.

Update::md .update
  I am closing this feature as WONTFIX.

Resolved Jul 27, 2022, 10:01PM::md .update
  I ended up actually implementing this. Images can have a flag set that they
  are background images.
